IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAIN.
       AUTHOR. VALIDATION-PLATFORM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PROG-NAME      PIC X(8) VALUE "CALC    ".
       01  WS-INPUT-A        PIC 9(4) VALUE 10.
       01  WS-INPUT-B        PIC 9(4) VALUE 5.
       01  WS-RESULT         PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOGIC.
           DISPLAY "MAIN STARTED".
           DISPLAY "CALLING PROGRAM: " WS-PROG-NAME.

           CALL WS-PROG-NAME USING WS-INPUT-A, WS-INPUT-B, WS-RESULT.

           DISPLAY "RESULT=" WS-RESULT.

           STOP RUN.